# Force LF regardless of core.autocrlf - not strictly required for YAML
# (GitHub's parser doesn't care), but keeps these consistent with the rest of
# the pipeline (see Helm/.gitattributes, added after CRLF broke the bash
# scripts there) and avoids noisy line-ending-only diffs on Windows edits.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
